{"type":"text","timestamp":1794584874449,"sessionID":"ses_e2a6bf669ffeDZmzRxSZ41RNny","part":{"id":"prt_1d597f1cd002f0RaM8to9pyVSD","sessionID":"ses_e2a6bf669ffeDZmzRxSZ41RNny","messageID":"msg_1d597d484001ACpnYYHw5lwrtf","type":"text","text":"T014 is complete: the bridges were regenerated under the new name, the longest-key comment is generic, and the four typed-attach cases now use `/create:sk-skill`. Every verify check passed from the final state.\n\nFiles written:\n\n1. `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` — comment above the longest-key rule now uses `/group:name` inside `/group:name-parent`, and `DER` rewrote both marked blocks.\n2. `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` — the four `/create:skill` cases now use `/create:sk-skill`.\n3. Generated by `DER`: `scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json`, `lib/scorer/projection.ts`, `scripts/skill_advisor.py`.\n\nVerify output:\n\n```\n$ node $ADV/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs --check\n{\n  \"status\": \"fresh\",\n  \"counts\": {\n    \"commandMetadata\": 27,\n    \"doctorRoutes\": 36,\n    \"generated\": 63,\n    \"typescriptActive\": 46,\n    \"pythonActive\": 52\n  },\n  \"changed\": []\n}\nexit=0\n```\n\n```\n$ OLD $ADV/lib $ADV/scripts/command-bridges $ADV/scripts/skill_advisor.py $ADV/tests\nexit=1        (no output: nothing matched)\n```\n\n```\n$ rg -c 'command-create-sk-skill' $ADV/lib/scorer/projection.ts\n3\nexit=0\n```\n\n```\n$ TC\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\nexit=0\n```\n\n```\n$ env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts tests/command-attach.vitest.ts\n Test Files  2 passed (2)\n      Tests  24 passed (24)\nexit=0\n```\n\nThe checkbox in `tasks.md` was left unticked as instructed. Nothing is blocked on the operator.\n\nOne adjacent observation, not changed: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach.vitest.ts:75` still names the case \"reads the longest command when a prefix also matches\" with `/create:skill-parent`, which no longer exercises a prefix pair now that `/create:skill` is gone. T014 scoped only the four old-name cases in the guards test, so I left it for the coordinator to decide.","time":{"start":1794584867277,"end":1794584874449}}}
